<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="description" content="Compare Vietlott jackpots and odds with probability-based analysis. Explore AI-assisted number selection for Lotto, Mega, and Power for educational purposes."><meta name="robots" content="index,follow"><meta name="theme-color" content="#f8fafc"><link rel="canonical" href="https://phoenixflix.vercel.app/Vietlott.html"><title>Vietlott Lottery Analyzer | Odds &amp; AI Number Insights</title><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:title" content="Vietlott Lottery Analyzer | Odds &amp; AI Number Insights"><meta property="og:description" content="Compare Vietlott jackpots and odds with probability-based analysis. Explore AI-assisted number selection for Lotto, Mega, and Power for educational purposes."><meta property="og:image" content="https://phoenixflix.vercel.app/images/VietlottAnalysis.png"><meta property="og:image:alt" content="Vietlott lottery analysis preview"><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"><meta property="og:url" content="https://phoenixflix.vercel.app/Vietlott.html"><meta property="og:site_name" content="PhoenixFlix"><meta property="og:locale" content="en_US"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta name="twitter:title" content="Vietlott Lottery Analyzer | Odds &amp; AI Number Insights"><meta name="twitter:description" content="Compare Vietlott jackpots and odds with probability-based analysis. Explore AI-assisted number selection for Lotto, Mega, and Power for educational purposes."><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://phoenixflix.vercel.app/images/VietlottAnalysis.png"><script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><style>body{font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#1e293b}.loader{border:4px solid #e2e8f0;border-top:4px solid #ef4444;border-radius:50%;width:40px;height:40px;animation:spin 1s linear infinite}@keyframes spin{0%{transform:rotate(0)}100%{transform:rotate(360deg)}}.number-ball{width:3rem;height:3rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:9999px;font-weight:700;font-size:1.125rem;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,.1),0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ef4444 0,#dc2626 100%);border:2px solid #fee2e2}.number-ball.special{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eab308 0,#ca8a04 100%);border-color:#fef08a}.number-badge{padding:.5rem 1.5rem;border-radius:.75rem;font-weight:700;font-size:1.5rem;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,.1);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3b82f6 0,#2563eb 100%);letter-spacing:.1em}</style></head><body class="min-h-screen p-4 md:p-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-start"><div class="max-w-5xl w-full bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col lg:flex-row border border-gray-100"><div class="w-full lg:w-5/12 p-6 md:p-8 border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-gray-200 bg-gray-50"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6"><div class="bg-red-100 p-2 rounded-xl"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-8 w-8 text-red-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg></div><h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 tracking-tight">Vietnam Lottery Analyzer</h1></div><p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-5 leading-relaxed">Math-based analysis of current Vietlott jackpots vs winning odds. Choose an input method:</p><div class="flex rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 mb-5 text-xs font-bold" role="group" aria-label="Analysis input method"><button data-opt="1" class="opt-tab min-h-[44px] flex-1 px-1 bg-red-500 text-white transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-red-700">1. Manual</button> <button data-opt="2" class="opt-tab min-h-[44px] flex-1 px-1 bg-white text-gray-500 hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors border-l border-r border-gray-200 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-red-700">2. Paste Text</button> <button data-opt="3" class="opt-tab min-h-[44px] flex-1 px-1 bg-white text-gray-500 hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-red-700">3. AI Image</button></div><div id="opt-1" class="opt-panel"><p class="text-xs text-green-600 font-semibold mb-3">&#9989; No API Key Required &mdash; Pure Math</p><p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Please enter current jackpot values below if not using the default values of 6B - 12B - 30B</p><div class="space-y-3"><div><label for="manual-lotto" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-gray-600 mb-1">Lotto 5/35 Jackpot (Billion VND)</label> <input type="number" id="manual-lotto" step="0.01" min="0" placeholder="e.g. 6.87" class="w-full min-h-[44px] border border-gray-300 rounded-xl p-2.5 text-base focus:ring-2 focus:ring-red-500 focus:border-red-500 outline-none shadow-sm"></div><div><label for="manual-mega" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-gray-600 mb-1">Mega 6/45 Jackpot (Billion VND)</label> <input type="number" id="manual-mega" step="0.01" min="0" placeholder="e.g. 26.44" class="w-full min-h-[44px] border border-gray-300 rounded-xl p-2.5 text-base focus:ring-2 focus:ring-red-500 focus:border-red-500 outline-none shadow-sm"></div><div><label for="manual-power" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-gray-600 mb-1">Power 6/55 Jackpot (Billion VND)</label> <input type="number" id="manual-power" step="0.01" min="0" placeholder="e.g. 177.13" class="w-full min-h-[44px] border border-gray-300 rounded-xl p-2.5 text-base focus:ring-2 focus:ring-red-500 focus:border-red-500 outline-none shadow-sm"></div></div></div><div id="opt-2" class="opt-panel hidden"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2"><p class="text-xs text-green-600 font-semibold">&#9989; No API Key Required &mdash; Pure Math</p><button id="load-example" class="min-h-[44px] px-2 text-xs text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 underline focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-blue-500">Load example</button></div><p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mb-2">Copy all text from the Vietlott app home screen and paste below.</p><label for="text-input" class="sr-only">Vietlott app text</label> <textarea id="text-input" rows="8" class="w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-xl p-3 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-red-500 focus:border-red-500 outline-none transition-all shadow-sm resize-none text-base font-mono" placeholder="Paste Vietlott app text here..."></textarea></div><div id="opt-3" class="opt-panel hidden"><p class="text-xs text-orange-500 font-semibold mb-3">&#128273; Requires AI API Key &mdash; Gemini, ChatGPT, Grok, etc.</p><div class="mb-3 rounded-xl border border-purple-200 bg-purple-50 p-3"><p class="text-xs font-bold text-purple-800 mb-1">&#129504; An algorithm-based alternative to lucky picks</p><p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-gray-700">Unlike generators that rely on zodiac signs, lucky charms, or personal guesses, Option 3 uses AI-assisted historical draw-frequency patterns and a weighted-random algorithm to generate numbers. It is a different selection method, not a prediction or a guarantee of better odds.</p></div><div class="mb-3"><label for="api-key-input" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-gray-600 mb-1">AI API Key</label> <input type="password" id="api-key-input" class="w-full min-h-[44px] border border-gray-300 rounded-xl p-2.5 text-base focus:ring-2 focus:ring-red-500 focus:border-red-500 outline-none shadow-sm" placeholder="Paste your AI API key (Gemini, ChatGPT, Grok...)" autocomplete="off" value=""></div><div class="border-2 border-gray-300 border-dashed rounded-xl hover:border-red-400 hover:bg-red-50 transition-all cursor-pointer relative group" style="height:160px" id="upload-container"><div class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center space-y-1 text-center" id="upload-placeholder"><svg class="h-10 w-10 text-gray-400 group-hover:text-red-500 transition-colors" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 48 48"><path d="M28 8H12a4 4 0 00-4 4v20m32-12v8m0 0v8a4 4 0 01-4 4H12a4 4 0 01-4-4v-4m32-4l-3.172-3.172a4 4 0 00-5.656 0L28 28M8 32l9.172-9.172a4 4 0 015.656 0L28 28m0 0l4 4m4-24h8m-4-4v8m-12 4h.02" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> <label for="image-upload" class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-medium text-red-600 hover:text-red-500"><span>Browse files</span> <input id="image-upload" name="image-upload" type="file" accept="image/*" class="sr-only"></label><p class="text-xs text-gray-400">PNG, JPG, WEBP</p></div><img id="image-preview" class="hidden absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-contain rounded-xl p-1" src="" alt="Preview"> <button id="remove-image" class="hidden absolute top-2 right-2 bg-white text-red-600 rounded-full p-1.5 shadow-md hover:bg-red-50 transition-colors z-10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"/></svg></button></div></div><button id="analyze-btn" class="w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-red-600 to-red-500 hover:from-red-700 hover:to-red-600 text-white font-bold py-3.5 px-4 rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-red-500/30 transition-all transform active:scale-95 flex items-center justify-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M11.3 1.046A1 1 0 0112 2v5h4a1 1 0 01.82 1.573l-7 10A1 1 0 018 18v-5H4a1 1 0 01-.82-1.573l7-10a1 1 0 011.12-.38z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg> Analyze Deal</button></div><div class="w-full lg:w-7/12 p-6 md:p-8 bg-white flex flex-col relative"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 border-b pb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-green-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg> Analysis Results</h2><div id="content-area" class="flex-grow flex flex-col"><div id="welcome-state" class="flex-grow flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-gray-400 opacity-60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-20 w-20 mb-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 17v-2m3 2v-4m3 4v-6m2 10H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/></svg><p class="text-center font-medium">Awaiting input... Upload an image or paste text to get started.</p></div><div id="loading-state" class="hidden flex-grow flex-col items-center justify-center"><div class="loader mb-6"></div><p class="text-gray-600 font-medium animate-pulse text-lg">Crunching the numbers...</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-2">Consulting the mathematical oracle.</p></div><div id="error-state" class="hidden bg-red-50 border-l-4 border-red-500 text-red-700 p-4 rounded-r-lg mb-4"><p class="font-bold flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M18 10a8 8 0 11-16 0 8 8 0 0116 0zm-7 4a1 1 0 11-2 0 1 1 0 012 0zm-1-9a1 1 0 00-1 1v4a1 1 0 102 0V6a1 1 0 00-1-1z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg> Error</p><p id="error-message" class="text-sm mt-1"></p></div><div id="success-state" class="hidden flex-col h-full"><div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6 relative"><div class="absolute -top-3 -right-3 text-4xl">🕵️‍♂️</div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-blue-800 mb-2">Advisor's Verdict</h3><div id="analysis-text" class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed space-y-3"></div></div><div class="mt-auto pt-6 border-t border-gray-100"><h3 class="text-gray-800 font-bold text-lg mb-1 text-center">✨ Lucky Numbers for All Types ✨</h3><p id="lottery-type-label" class="text-sm text-red-500 font-semibold text-center mb-4"></p><div id="lucky-numbers-display" class="flex flex-col gap-1"></div></div></div></div></div></div><script>let activeOpt="1";document.querySelectorAll(".opt-tab").forEach(e=>{e.addEventListener("click",()=>{activeOpt=e.dataset.opt,document.querySelectorAll(".opt-tab").forEach(e=>{e.classList.toggle("bg-red-500",e.dataset.opt===activeOpt),e.classList.toggle("text-white",e.dataset.opt===activeOpt),e.classList.toggle("bg-white",e.dataset.opt!==activeOpt),e.classList.toggle("text-gray-500",e.dataset.opt!==activeOpt)}),document.querySelectorAll(".opt-panel").forEach(e=>e.classList.add("hidden")),document.getElementById("opt-"+activeOpt).classList.remove("hidden")})});const apiKeyInput=document.getElementById("api-key-input"),imageUpload=document.getElementById("image-upload"),imagePreview=document.getElementById("image-preview"),uploadPlaceholder=document.getElementById("upload-placeholder"),removeImageBtn=document.getElementById("remove-image"),textInput=document.getElementById("text-input"),analyzeBtn=document.getElementById("analyze-btn"),welcomeState=document.getElementById("welcome-state"),loadingState=document.getElementById("loading-state"),errorState=document.getElementById("error-state"),errorMessage=document.getElementById("error-message"),successState=document.getElementById("success-state"),analysisText=document.getElementById("analysis-text"),luckyNumbersDisplay=document.getElementById("lucky-numbers-display"),lotteryTypeLabel=document.getElementById("lottery-type-label");let currentBase64Image=null,currentMimeType=null;imageUpload.addEventListener("change",function(e){const t=e.target.files[0];if(t){const e=new FileReader;e.onload=function(e){currentBase64Image=e.target.result.split(",")[1],currentMimeType=t.type,imagePreview.src=e.target.result,imagePreview.classList.remove("hidden"),removeImageBtn.classList.remove("hidden"),uploadPlaceholder.classList.add("hidden")},e.readAsDataURL(t)}}),removeImageBtn.addEventListener("click",function(e){e.preventDefault(),imageUpload.value="",currentBase64Image=null,currentMimeType=null,imagePreview.classList.add("hidden"),imagePreview.src="",removeImageBtn.classList.add("hidden"),uploadPlaceholder.classList.remove("hidden")});const getUniqueRandoms=(e,t,a)=>{const n=new Set;for(;n.size<e;)n.add(Math.floor(Math.random()*(a-t+1))+t);return Array.from(n).sort((e,t)=>e-t)};function buildNumberRow(e,t,a,n=!1){const r=document.createElement("div");r.className="mb-3 p-3 rounded-xl border "+(n?"border-red-300 bg-red-50":"border-gray-100 bg-gray-50");const o=document.createElement("p");o.className="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 "+(n?"text-red-600":"text-gray-500"),o.textContent=t,r.appendChild(o);const l=document.createElement("div");l.className="flex flex-wrap gap-2 justify-center",a(l),r.appendChild(l),e.appendChild(r)}function createBall(e,t=!1){const a=document.createElement("div");return a.className="number-ball "+(t?"special":""),a.textContent=e.toString().padStart(2,"0"),a}function createBadge(e){const t=document.createElement("div");return t.className="number-badge",t.textContent=e,t}const FREQ={lotto:{3:1.6,7:1.6,12:1.6,18:1.6,23:1.6,1:1.2,5:1.2,9:1.2,15:1.2,20:1.2,27:1.2,31:1.2,2:.8,11:.8,22:.8,33:.8},lottoSpecial:{3:1.6,7:1.6,11:1.6,1:1.2,5:1.2,9:1.2,2:.8,8:.8},mega:{6:1.6,14:1.6,21:1.6,29:1.6,36:1.6,42:1.6,2:1.2,8:1.2,17:1.2,24:1.2,31:1.2,38:1.2,44:1.2,4:.8,19:.8,33:.8,40:.8},power:{5:1.6,13:1.6,22:1.6,30:1.6,39:1.6,47:1.6,3:1.2,9:1.2,18:1.2,26:1.2,34:1.2,43:1.2,51:1.2,7:.8,25:.8,37:.8,50:.8}};function weightedPick(e,t,a,n){const r=[];for(let e=t;e<=a;e++){const t=Math.round(100*(n[e]||1));for(let a=0;a<t;a++)r.push(e)}const o=new Set;let l=0;for(;o.size<e&&l<1e4;)o.add(r[Math.floor(Math.random()*r.length)]),l++;return Array.from(o).sort((e,t)=>e-t)}function buildFreqFromHot(e,t,a){if(!e||!e.length)return null;const n={};for(let e=t;e<=a;e++)n[e]=.9;return e.forEach(e=>{e>=t&&e<=a&&(n[e]=1.8)}),n}function calcAndRender(e,t=null){GAMES[2].prizeB=e.lotto,GAMES[3].prizeB=e.mega,GAMES[4].prizeB=e.power,GAMES._hotNumbers=t}function generateAllLuckyNumbers(e,t=null){luckyNumbersDisplay.innerHTML="";const a="3"===activeOpt,n=a&&t?" 🧠 AI-weighted (AI suggestions)":a?" 🦥 AI-weighted (built-in)":" 🎲 Random";lotteryTypeLabel.textContent="🎯 Detected: "+e+n;const r=buildFreqFromHot(t&&t.lotto,1,35)||FREQ.lotto,o=buildFreqFromHot(t&&t.lottoSpecial,1,12)||FREQ.lottoSpecial,l=buildFreqFromHot(t&&t.mega,1,45)||FREQ.mega,s=buildFreqFromHot(t&&t.power,1,55)||FREQ.power,i=(e,t,n,r)=>a?weightedPick(e,t,n,r):getUniqueRandoms(e,t,n);buildNumberRow(luckyNumbersDisplay,"Max 3D (Basic) — 1 set",e=>{e.appendChild(createBadge(Math.floor(1e3*Math.random()).toString().padStart(3,"0")))},"Max 3D"===e),buildNumberRow(luckyNumbersDisplay,"Max 3D+ — 2 sets",e=>{e.appendChild(createBadge(Math.floor(1e3*Math.random()).toString().padStart(3,"0"))),e.appendChild(createBadge(Math.floor(1e3*Math.random()).toString().padStart(3,"0")))},"Max 3D+"===e),buildNumberRow(luckyNumbersDisplay,"Lotto 5/35 — 5 + 1 special"+(a?" 🧠":""),e=>{i(5,1,35,r).forEach(t=>e.appendChild(createBall(t)));const t=document.createElement("span");t.className="text-gray-300 text-xl font-light self-center",t.textContent="|",e.appendChild(t),e.appendChild(createBall(weightedPick(1,1,12,o)[0],!0))},"Lotto 5/35"===e),buildNumberRow(luckyNumbersDisplay,"Mega 6/45 — 6 numbers"+(a?" 🧠":""),e=>{i(6,1,45,l).forEach(t=>e.appendChild(createBall(t)))},"Mega 6/45"===e),buildNumberRow(luckyNumbersDisplay,"Power 6/55 — 6 numbers"+(a?" 🧠":""),e=>{i(6,1,55,s).forEach(t=>e.appendChild(createBall(t)))},"Power 6/55"===e)}const GAMES=[{key:"max3d",label:"Max 3D",diffMultiplier:1,fixedPrizeB:.001},{key:"max3dp",label:"Max 3D+",diffMultiplier:1e3,fixedPrizeB:1},{key:"lotto",label:"Lotto 5/35",diffMultiplier:7791,fixedPrizeB:null},{key:"mega",label:"Mega 6/45",diffMultiplier:16290,fixedPrizeB:null},{key:"power",label:"Power 6/55",diffMultiplier:57979,fixedPrizeB:null}];function calcAndRender(e,t=null){GAMES[2].prizeB=e.lotto,GAMES[3].prizeB=e.mega,GAMES[4].prizeB=e.power;let a="";GAMES.forEach(e=>{const t=null!==e.fixedPrizeB?e.fixedPrizeB:e.prizeB,n=Math.round(1e3*t),r=e.diffMultiplier,o="max3d"===e.key||"max3dp"===e.key,l=n>r,s=o?'<span class="text-blue-500 font-bold">&#128204; BASELINE</span>':l?'<span class="text-green-600 font-bold">&#9989; GOOD DEAL</span>':'<span class="text-red-500 font-bold">&#10060; BAD DEAL</span>',i=t>=1?t.toFixed(1)+"B":(1e3*t).toFixed(0)+"M",d=o?'<span class="text-gray-400">—</span>':'<span class="font-bold '+(l?"text-green-600":"text-red-500")+'">'+(n/r).toFixed(3)+"</span>";a+='<tr class="border-b border-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-50"><td class="py-2 px-3 font-semibold text-gray-800 text-sm">'+e.label+'</td><td class="py-2 px-3 text-center text-sm">'+i+' VND</td><td class="py-2 px-3 text-center text-sm">x '+n.toLocaleString()+'</td><td class="py-2 px-3 text-center text-sm">x '+r.toLocaleString()+'</td><td class="py-2 px-3 text-center text-sm">'+d+'</td><td class="py-2 px-3 text-center text-sm">'+s+"</td></tr>"});const n=GAMES.slice(2).reduce((e,t)=>1e3*t.prizeB/t.diffMultiplier>1e3*e.prizeB/e.diffMultiplier?t:e),r=(1e3*n.prizeB/n.diffMultiplier).toFixed(3);analysisText.innerHTML='<div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full text-left"><thead><tr class="bg-gray-100 text-xs uppercase text-gray-500"><th class="py-2 px-3">Game</th><th class="py-2 px-3 text-center">Prize</th><th class="py-2 px-3 text-center">"x Prize"</th><th class="py-2 px-3 text-center">"x Difficulty"</th><th class="py-2 px-3 text-center">Smart Ratio</th><th class="py-2 px-3 text-center">Verdict</th></tr></thead><tbody>'+a+'</tbody></table></div><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-600">&#127942; Best value: <strong>'+n.label+'</strong> &mdash; "x Prize" <strong>'+Math.round(1e3*n.prizeB).toLocaleString()+'</strong> / "x Difficulty" <strong>'+n.diffMultiplier.toLocaleString()+"</strong> = ratio <strong>"+r+'</strong> (higher = better deal).</p><p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">Baseline: Max 3D = 1M VND, odds 1/500. "x Prize" = jackpot / 1M. "x Difficulty" = odds / (1/500).</p>',generateAllLuckyNumbers(n.label,t),showSuccess()}function parseJackpotsFromText(e){const t=t=>{const a=e.indexOf(t);if(-1===a)return null;const n=e.slice(a).match(/([\d]{1,3}(?:\.[\d]{3})+)\u20ab/);return n?(r=n[1],parseFloat(r.replace(/\./g,""))/1e9):null;var r};return{lotto:t("logo535")||6,mega:t("Giá trị Jackpot\n")||t("Giá trị Jackpot \n")||12,power:t("Giá trị Jackpot 1")||30}}async function analyzeDeal(){if(showLoading(),"1"===activeOpt){const e=parseFloat(document.getElementById("manual-lotto").value)||6,t=parseFloat(document.getElementById("manual-mega").value)||12,a=parseFloat(document.getElementById("manual-power").value)||30;return void calcAndRender({lotto:e,mega:t,power:a})}if("2"===activeOpt){const e=textInput.value.trim();return e?void calcAndRender(parseJackpotsFromText(e)):void showError("Please paste the Vietlott app text first.")}if(!currentBase64Image)return void showError("Please upload a screenshot first.");const e=apiKeyInput.value.trim();if(!e)return void showError("Please enter your AI API key for image reading.");const t={contents:[{role:"user",parts:[{text:"Extract jackpot values and provide hot numbers from this screenshot."},{inlineData:{mimeType:currentMimeType,data:currentBase64Image}}]}],systemInstruction:{parts:[{text:'You have two jobs:\n1. Extract the current jackpot values (in billions VND) for Vietlott games from the image.\n2. Based on your knowledge of Vietlott historical draw frequency, provide the top 6 hot numbers for each game.\nReturn ONLY this raw JSON, no markdown, no explanation:\n{"lotto":6,"mega":12,"power":30,"hotNumbers":{"lotto":[3,7,12,18,23,28],"lottoSpecial":[3,7,11,1,5,9],"mega":[6,14,21,29,36,42],"power":[5,13,22,30,39,47]}}\n- Jackpot values must be numbers in billions (e.g. 26.4 billion = 26.4)\n- If a jackpot value is not visible, use its starting default: lotto=6, mega=12, power=30\n- hotNumbers must always be provided using your training knowledge of Vietlott historical frequency\n- lotto: 6 most frequently drawn numbers from 1-35\n- lottoSpecial: 6 most frequently drawn special ball numbers from 1-12\n- mega: 6 most frequently drawn numbers from 1-45\n- power: 6 most frequently drawn numbers from 1-55\n- Do NOT add any other keys'}]},generationConfig:{responseMimeType:"application/json"}};try{const a=await fetch("https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-2.5-flash:generateContent",{method:"POST",headers:{"Content-Type":"application/json","x-goog-api-key":e},body:JSON.stringify(t)});if(!a.ok){const e=await a.json().catch(()=>({}));throw new Error("API Error "+a.status+": "+(e?.error?.message||a.statusText))}const n=await a.json(),r=n.candidates[0].content.parts[0].text.trim().replace(/^```json\s*/i,"").replace(/^```\s*/i,"").replace(/\s*```$/i,"").trim(),o=JSON.parse(r),l=o.hotNumbers||null;calcAndRender({lotto:Number(o.lotto)||6,mega:Number(o.mega)||12,power:Number(o.power)||30},l)}catch(e){showError(e.message||"An error occurred."),console.error(e)}}const EXAMPLE_TEXT="0₫\nhome_gift\nbell5\n\ncash_out\nRút tiền\n\ncash_in\nNạp tiền\n\n\nTải QR nạp\n\nXổ 2 lần/ ngày\nlogo535\n\n\nKỳ #00960\n\n6.869.607.500₫\n\n06 : 01 : 31\ntuivangchia\nChơi ngay\nXổ 6 phút/ kỳ\nbingo18\nKQ kỳ #0192329\nbingo1\nbingo2\nbingo4\nKỳ tiếp:\n00:32\n\nChơi ngay\nNay xổ\nlogo\nGiá trị Jackpot\n\n26.444.954.000₫\n\n03 : 01 : 31\nKỳ #01578\n\nThứ 4\n\n21/10/2026\n\n\nChơi ngay\nMai xổ\nlogo\nGiá trị Jackpot 1\n\n177.132.635.850₫\n\n27 : 01 : 31\nKỳ #01414\n\nThứ 5\n\n22/10/2026";function showLoading(){welcomeState.classList.add("hidden"),errorState.classList.add("hidden"),successState.classList.add("hidden"),loadingState.classList.remove("hidden"),loadingState.classList.add("flex"),analyzeBtn.disabled=!0,analyzeBtn.classList.add("opacity-70","cursor-wait"),analyzeBtn.innerHTML='<div class="w-5 h-5 border-2 border-white border-t-transparent rounded-full animate-spin"></div> Analyzing...'}function showError(e){loadingState.classList.add("hidden"),loadingState.classList.remove("flex"),errorState.classList.remove("hidden"),errorMessage.textContent=e,resetButton()}function showSuccess(){loadingState.classList.add("hidden"),loadingState.classList.remove("flex"),errorState.classList.add("hidden"),successState.classList.remove("hidden"),successState.classList.add("flex"),resetButton()}function resetButton(){analyzeBtn.disabled=!1,analyzeBtn.classList.remove("opacity-70","cursor-wait"),analyzeBtn.innerHTML='<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">\n                    <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M11.3 1.046A1 1 0 0112 2v5h4a1 1 0 01.82 1.573l-7 10A1 1 0 018 18v-5H4a1 1 0 01-.82-1.573l7-10a1 1 0 011.12-.38z" clip-rule="evenodd" />\n                </svg> Analyze Deal'}document.getElementById("load-example").addEventListener("click",()=>{textInput.value=EXAMPLE_TEXT}),analyzeBtn.addEventListener("click",analyzeDeal)</script><div class="max-w-5xl w-full mt-6 mb-8 bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-xl border border-gray-100 p-6 md:p-8"><h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-1">&#128218; Ph&#226;n t&#237;ch t&#7927; l&#7879; c&#432;&#7907;c x&#7893; s&#7889; Vietlott</h2><p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-5">Vietlott - Vietnam Lottery Analyzer&mdash; H&#432;&#7899;ng d&#7851;n &amp; Ph&#432;&#417;ng ph&#225;p t&#237;nh to&#225;n</p><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 text-sm text-gray-700"><div class="bg-blue-50 rounded-2xl p-4 border border-blue-100"><h3 class="font-bold text-blue-800 mb-2">&#128204; M&#7889;c chu&#7849;n (Baseline)</h3><p class="text-xs mb-2">Lu&#244;n s&#7917; d&#7909;ng <strong>Max 3D (C&#417; b&#7843;n)</strong> l&#224;m ti&#234;u chu&#7849;n g&#7889;c:</p><ul class="space-y-1 text-xs"><li>&#127381; <strong>Ti&#7873;n th&#432;&#7903;ng chu&#7849;n:</strong> 1.000.000 VN&#272; (1 Tri&#7879;u) &mdash; v&#233; 10.000 VN&#272;</li><li>&#127381; <strong>&#272;&#7897; kh&#243; chu&#7849;n (X&#225;c su&#7845;t):</strong> 1/500</li></ul><div class="mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-blue-200"><p class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-700 mb-2">H&#7879; s&#7889; &#272;&#7897; kh&#243; so v&#7899;i Max 3D (1/500):</p><ul class="space-y-1 text-xs"><li><strong>Max 3D+</strong>: 1/500.000 &rarr; g&#7845;p <strong>1.000x</strong> &mdash; c&#226;n b&#7857;ng ho&#224;n h&#7843;o 1:1</li><li><strong>Lotto 5/35</strong>: 1/3.895.584 &rarr; g&#7845;p <strong>~7.791x</strong></li><li><strong>Mega 6/45</strong>: 1/8.145.060 &rarr; g&#7845;p <strong>~16.290x</strong></li><li><strong>Power 6/55</strong>: 1/28.989.675 &rarr; g&#7845;p <strong>~57.979x</strong></li></ul></div></div><div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-4 border border-gray-200"><h3 class="font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">&#9881;&#65039; Quy tr&#236;nh t&#237;nh to&#225;n (4 b&#432;&#7899;c)</h3><ol class="space-y-2 text-xs"><li><span class="font-bold text-red-500">1.</span> &#272;&#7885;c gi&#225; tr&#7883; Jackpot hi&#7879;n t&#7841;i &rarr; &#273;&#7893;i ra <strong>tri&#7879;u VN&#272;</strong>.</li><li><span class="font-bold text-red-500">2.</span> <strong>"x Prize"</strong> = Jackpot (tri&#7879;u) &#247; 1 tri&#7879;u.<br><span class="text-gray-400">V&#237; d&#7909;: 26,4 t&#7927; = 26.400 tri&#7879;u &rarr; "x Prize" = 26.400</span></li><li><span class="font-bold text-red-500">3.</span> So s&#225;nh <strong>"x Prize"</strong> v&#7899;i <strong>"x Difficulty"</strong> (c&#7889; &#273;&#7883;nh, kh&#244;ng &#273;&#7893;i).</li><li><span class="font-bold text-red-500">4.</span> N&#7871;u <strong>"x Prize" &gt; "x Difficulty"</strong> &rarr; <span class="text-green-600 font-bold">GOOD DEAL &#9989;</span><br>N&#7871;u <strong>"x Prize" &lt; "x Difficulty"</strong> &rarr; <span class="text-red-500 font-bold">BAD DEAL &#10060;</span></li></ol></div><div class="md:col-span-2 bg-green-50 rounded-2xl p-4 border border-green-200"><h3 class="font-bold text-green-800 mb-2">&#127942; Cách xác định &ldquo;Kèo Ngon Nhất&rdquo; (Best Deal)</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-700 mb-3">Khi có <strong>nhiều giải cùng là Good Deal</strong>, dùng chỉ số <strong>Tỷ lệ đánh đổi (Trade-off Ratio)</strong> để chọn kèo tốt nhất:</p><div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-3 border border-green-200 text-center mb-3"><p class="text-sm font-bold text-green-700">Ratio = "x Prize" ÷ "x Difficulty"</p><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Ratio càng cao → Kèo càng có lợi về mặt toán học</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs"><div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-3 border border-green-100"><p class="font-bold text-gray-700 mb-1">Ví dụ: Mega 6/45 @ 26,4 tỷ</p><p>"x Prize" = <strong>26.445</strong></p><p>"x Difficulty" = <strong>16.290</strong></p><p class="mt-1 text-green-700 font-bold">Ratio = 26.445 ÷ 16.290 ≈ <span class="text-base">1.62</span></p></div><div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-3 border border-green-100"><p class="font-bold text-gray-700 mb-1">Ví dụ: Power 6/55 @ 177,1 tỷ</p><p>"x Prize" = <strong>177.133</strong></p><p>"x Difficulty" = <strong>57.979</strong></p><p class="mt-1 text-green-700 font-bold">Ratio = 177.133 ÷ 57.979 ≈ <span class="text-base">3.05</span></p></div></div><p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-3">&#128073; Dù Power 6/55 khó trúng nhất, mức thưởng khổng lồ tạo ra Ratio <strong>3.05</strong> — gần gấp đôi Mega (1.62). Power 6/55 là <strong>&ldquo;Vua kèo&rdquo;</strong> ở thời điểm này.</p></div><div class="md:col-span-2 bg-yellow-50 rounded-2xl p-4 border border-yellow-200"><h3 class="font-bold text-yellow-800 mb-2">&#128161; V&#237; d&#7909; th&#7921;c t&#7871;</h3><p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-gray-700">&ldquo;Nh&#236;n v&#224;o &#7843;nh b&#7841;n g&#7917;i, gi&#7843;i <strong>Mega 6/45</strong> hi&#7879;n &#273;ang &#273;&#432;&#7907;c nh&#7891;i l&#234;n m&#7913;c <strong>26,4 t&#7927;</strong>. Ph&#226;n t&#237;ch b&#224;i to&#225;n nh&#432; sau: Ti&#7873;n th&#432;&#7903;ng l&#250;c n&#224;y &#273;ang g&#7845;p <strong>26.400 l&#7847;n</strong> so v&#7899;i Max 3D (m&#7889;c 1 tri&#7879;u), nh&#432;ng &#273;&#7897; kh&#243; c&#7911;a Mega th&#236; c&#7889; &#273;&#7883;nh &#7903; m&#7913;c g&#7845;p <strong>16.290 l&#7847;n</strong> (so v&#7899;i m&#7889;c 1/500 c&#7911;a Max 3D). R&#245; r&#224;ng t&#7889;c &#273;&#7897; ph&#236;nh to c&#7911;a ti&#7873;n th&#432;&#7903;ng &#273;&#227; v&#432;&#7907;t qua r&#224;o c&#7843;n &#273;&#7897; kh&#243;. &#7902; th&#7901;i &#273;i&#7875;m qu&#7929; th&#432;&#7903;ng &#273;&#432;&#7907;c c&#7897;ng d&#7891;n cao th&#7871; n&#224;y, Mega 6/45 l&#224; m&#7897;t l&#7921;a ch&#7885;n t&#7889;i &#432;u h&#417;n h&#7859;n v&#7873; m&#7863;t to&#225;n h&#7885;c so v&#7899;i &#273;&#225;nh Max 3D.&rdquo;</p></div><div class="md:col-span-2 rounded-2xl p-4 border-2 border-purple-300 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-indigo-50"><h3 class="font-bold text-purple-800 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2 text-base">&#129504; AI-Weighted Probability &mdash; How Option 3 Works</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-700 mb-3"><strong>Option 3 takes a different approach from lucky-number generators based on zodiac signs, lucky charms, or personal guesses.</strong> It uses AI to read jackpot values and suggest historically frequent numbers, then applies a weighted-random algorithm. Options 1 and 2 generate number picks uniformly at random. Works with <strong>Gemini, ChatGPT, Grok</strong>, or any vision-capable AI.</p><div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-3"><div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-3 border border-purple-100"><p class="text-xs font-bold text-purple-700 mb-1">&#9312; AI Reads Screenshot</p><p class="text-xs text-gray-600">Extracts current jackpot values and asks the AI to suggest historically frequent numbers. Suggestions come from the AI provider, not a verified draw-history database.</p></div><div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-3 border border-purple-100"><p class="text-xs font-bold text-purple-700 mb-1">&#9313; buildFreqFromHot()</p><p class="text-xs text-gray-600">AI-returned hot numbers get <strong class="text-purple-700">1.8x weight</strong>. All other numbers get <strong class="text-gray-500">0.9x weight</strong>. Converts the list into a probability pool.</p></div><div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-3 border border-purple-100"><p class="text-xs font-bold text-purple-700 mb-1">&#9314; weightedPick()</p><p class="text-xs text-gray-600">Samples from the weighted pool without replacement &mdash; hot numbers appear ~2x more often than cold ones in the final output.</p></div></div><div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-3 border border-purple-200 mb-3"><p class="text-xs font-bold text-purple-800 mb-2">&#127381; 3 Generation Modes</p><div class="space-y-1 text-xs"><div class="flex items-start gap-2"><span>&#127922;</span><div><strong>Random</strong> &mdash; Options 1 &amp; 2. Pure uniform random, every number has equal chance.</div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-2"><span>&#129504;</span><div><strong>AI-weighted (AI suggestions)</strong> &mdash; Option 3 uses numbers suggested by the AI from its learned knowledge of historical draw patterns.</div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-2"><span>&#129445;</span><div><strong>AI-weighted (built-in)</strong> &mdash; Option 3 fallback. Uses hardcoded frequency tiers (hot=1.6x, warm=1.2x, cool=0.8x) if AI doesn't return hot numbers.</div></div></div></div><p class="text-xs text-purple-700 font-semibold">&#128161; When AI-suggested numbers are unavailable, Option 3 falls back to built-in approximate historical frequency weights.</p><p class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-2">&#9888;&#65039; Past draw frequencies do not predict future results. Lottery draws are independent, and this number-selection method does not improve the official odds of winning.</p><p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">&#9888;&#65039; Currently wired to Gemini API endpoint. To use ChatGPT or Grok, update the API URL and request/response format in the source code.</p><div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"><img src="images/ScreenshotUI.png" alt="Example AI-weighted lucky number screenshot" class="block h-auto w-full rounded-xl border border-purple-200" loading="lazy"> <img src="images/AI_weighted_Probability_Theory.png" alt="Example AI-weighted lucky number results" class="block h-auto w-full rounded-xl border border-purple-200" loading="lazy"></div></div><div class="md:col-span-2 bg-orange-50 rounded-2xl p-4 border border-orange-200"><h3 class="font-bold text-orange-800 mb-2">&#9888;&#65039; Disclaimer &mdash; Math &#8800; Decision</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">This tool is based purely on <strong>math and probability algorithms</strong>. The verdict (Good Deal / Bad Deal) reflects only the <strong>expected value ratio</strong> &mdash; it does <em>not</em> account for:</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-xs text-gray-600"><li>&#127919; <strong>Personal choice</strong> &mdash; you may prefer a smaller jackpot with better odds</li><li>&#128176; <strong>Budget &amp; situation</strong> &mdash; how much you can comfortably spend matters more than ratios</li><li>&#9878;&#65039; <strong>Risk tolerance</strong> &mdash; a &ldquo;Bad Deal&rdquo; game may still be the right pick for your risk appetite</li><li>&#127340; <strong>Personal references</strong> &mdash; lucky numbers, game familiarity, or simply what feels right to you</li></ul><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-orange-700 font-semibold">&#128161; Use this as one data point, not the final answer. For case analysis only !</p><div class="mt-4 rounded-xl border-2 border-purple-300 bg-purple-50 p-4"><h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-purple-900">&#129504; What makes this approach different?</h4><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-gray-700">Some lottery-number generators, such as <a href="https://www.lotterynumbergenerator.net/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-semibold text-purple-700 underline">Lottery Number Generator</a>, offer selections inspired by lucky numbers, zodiac signs, or lucky charms. This tool instead explores algorithms, probability concepts, and AI-assisted number weighting based on suggested historical draw-frequency patterns.</p><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-gray-700">The AI suggestions are not drawn from a verified, complete historical-results database, and historical frequencies cannot predict future draws. Lottery draws are independent events, so generated numbers are not predictions and do not improve the official odds of winning.</p></div><div class="mt-3 rounded-xl border-2 border-red-300 bg-red-50 p-4"><h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-red-800">&#9888;&#65039; Educational use only &mdash; Not a gambling recommendation</h4><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-red-900">Results are not guaranteed to win. This tool is intended for educational and research purposes to explore mathematical concepts in probability and optimization; it is not a recommendation to gamble or bet. Jackpot odds vary by game and can be extremely low such as 1 in several million !</p><p class="mt-2 text-xs font-bold leading-relaxed text-red-900">Lottery is legal and can be useful for the organizers and customers.</p><p class="mt-2 text-xs font-bold italic leading-relaxed text-red-900">However, it is important to remember that the lottery should not be a primary source of income or a substitute for financial planning. Instead, you can try investing in the stock market or exploring other retirement planning options.</p></div></div></div></div><footer class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-6 text-center"><p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Disclaimer: This document is primarily intended as a case study for exploring optimizations, algorithms, and the application of AI and probability theories. The findings and conclusions presented herein are for educational and research purposes only.</p></footer><footer class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 pb-6 text-center text-sm text-gray-600"><span>&copy; 2026 <a href="https://PhoenixFlix.Vercel.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline">PhoenixFlix</a></span> | <a href="https://github.com/PhoenixWeaver" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline">PhoenixWeaver</a></footer></body></html>